                "text_excerpt": "We also rigorously show that a random-walk based rewiring method might generally fail to obtain an edge set E′ with a significant improvement in its bottleneckedness as measured by the Cheeger constant."
              },
              "quantitative_value": null,
              "result_id": "res_f112e70ba58dd29a6b0c89c9",
              "unit": null,
              "value_raw_text": "Random-walk based rewiring may fail to significantly improve the Cheeger constant."
